{"quest_id": 4456, "name": "未完の巨兵", "description": "ゴーレムを探しに魔法都市を訪れた\n付与魔術師エルシャとともに、\n未完成のゴーレムを止めろ！\n中級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃8体）", "event": "ゴールドラッシュ9(2016)", "event_category": "Reproduce", "mission_id": 300084, "map_no": 5408, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "exp": 250, "gold": 800, "drops": [{"item": 1008, "c": 1}, {"item": 1001, "c": 2}, {"card": 129, "c": 1}, {"card": 86}], "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 10, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 3000, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 250, "magic_defense": 50, "attack_range": 150, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 40, "attack_interval": 161, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2102288, "special_effect_id": 229, "missile_id": 108, "missile": {"speed": 8.0}, "master_id": 372, "global_id": 371, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 3}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 10000, "attack": 1800, "base_hp": 10000, "base_attack": 1800, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 420, "magic_defense": 40, "attack_speed": 300, "attack_wait": 120, "attack_interval": 711, "move_speed": 120.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2099712, "race_id": 5, "master_id": 495, "global_id": 494, "spawn_sec": 8}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 3000, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 250, "magic_defense": 50, "attack_range": 150, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 40, "attack_interval": 161, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2102400, "special_effect_id": 229, "missile_id": 108, "missile": {"speed": 8.0}, "master_id": 431, "global_id": 430, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 80}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 1, "level": 90, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 40000, "attack": 4100, "base_hp": 40000, "base_attack": 4100, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 2000, "magic_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 300, "attack_wait": 120, "attack_interval": 711, "move_speed": 120.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.7000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2100784, "race_id": 5, "master_id": 296, "global_id": 295, "spawn_sec": 82}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "エルシャ", "text": "さあ、こちらです。\nあの研究塔の中に隠しておいたんです。", "face": "u281"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "まだ、魔物に操られていないゴーレムが\n残っているかもしれないんですね。", "face": "l9be3de2707a5"}, {"name": "エルシャ", "text": "はい。\n魔法都市に魔物が現れた時はまだ未完成\nだったので、魔物に操られずに済みました。", "face": "u281"}, {"name": "兵士", "text": "報告！\nゴーレムの姿を確認！\nこちらに向かってきています！", "face": "l2b2417eb171c"}]}, {"trigger": "battle", "at_sec": 10, "lines": [{"name": "モルディベート", "text": "なんだか騒がしいわね……。\nまだゴーレム相手に抵抗をする\n魔術師が残ってるのかしら。", "face": "u86"}, {"name": "モルディベート", "text": "まあ、私には関係ないことだけど……。\n人間も魔物もどちらも興味はないわ。故郷も、\n仲間も失った……。私の戦は終わったのよ。", "face": "u86"}]}, {"trigger": "battle", "at_sec": 84, "lines": [{"name": "エルシャ", "text": "あのゴーレムは……！\nあれはたしか修理の途中だったものです。", "face": "u281"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "修理中、ですか。\n通常のゴーレムとは何か違うのですか？", "face": "l9be3de2707a5"}, {"name": "エルシャ", "text": "はい。射撃武器が壊れているんです。\nあの３体のゴーレムは拳を飛ばすことができません。", "face": "u281"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "なるほど。普段ならば絶望的な状況ですが、\n戦い方次第では勝機があるということですね。\nさあ、王子ご命令を！", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "エルシャ", "text": "私も付与魔術でお手伝いいたします。", "face": "u281"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "兵士", "text": "一時はどうなることかと思いましたが、\nなんとかなるものですね！", "face": "l2b2417eb171c"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "戦術の勝利、ですね。", "face": "u114"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "モルディベート", "text": "まだ、魔物と戦う人間が残っていたみたいね。\n不完全な状態とはいえ巨大なゴーレムを\n３体倒すなんて……。", "face": "u86"}, {"name": "モルディベート", "text": "あの子たちについていけば、少しは楽しませて\nくれるかもしれない……。", "face": "u86"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map5408", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 79, "y": 509}, {"k": "m", "x": 134, "y": 135, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 648, "y": 369, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 748, "y": 414, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 240, "y": 185, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 508, "y": 385, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 847, "y": 460, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 370, "y": 365, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 356, "y": 237, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 501, "y": 207, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 655, "y": 229, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 718, "y": 300, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 301, "y": 300, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 162, "y": 468, "id": 212}, {"k": "m", "x": 267, "y": 415, "id": 213}, {"k": "m", "x": 505, "y": 296, "id": 214}, {"k": "r", "x": 193, "y": 260, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x": 198, "y": 333, "id": 301}, {"k": "r", "x": 824, "y": 342, "id": 302}, {"k": "r", "x": 897, "y": 378, "id": 303}, {"k": "r", "x": 617, "y": 451, "id": 304}, {"k": "r", "x": 519, "y": 460, "id": 305}, {"k": "r", "x": 413, "y": 453, "id": 306}, {"k": "r", "x": 119, "y": 375, "id": 307}, {"k": "r", "x": 119, "y": 223, "id": 308}, {"k": "r", "x": 386, "y": 125, "id": 309}, {"k": "r", "x": 302, "y": 91, "id": 310}]}, "start_cost": 10, "active": true}